@title Cabinet: Auto ducts puts a duct back between two rows that lost theirs (1366x768)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# Plan qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo has a duct between each pair of rows. The duct under the first
# row is deleted, then Auto ducts previews a new one there, Accept stores it, Ctrl+Z takes it back.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
click 780 241
wait 6
shot duct-selected
key Delete
wait 10
shot duct-deleted
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text auto ducts
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Auto ducts)"
expect "1 duct(s) would be added"
shot ducts-preview
key Enter
wait 10
shot ducts-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot ducts-undone
